    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>You create a force moonglaive and are treated as proficient with it for this spell. Make a ranged attack against the first target. On a hit, make a second ranged attack at -2 against another eligible target. If that hits, make a third ranged attack at -4 against a third target or back against the first. No two targets may be more than 15 feet apart. The glaive disappears after a miss or after the third attack.</p><p>Treat it as a normal moonglaive except that it is made of force: 1d4 damage if Small or 1d6 if Medium, slashing damage, critical 19-20/x2, and a 20-foot range increment.</p><p><strong>Automation boundary:</strong> Create the three attack sequence and select each ricochet target manually; the item does not generate follow-up attacks automatically.</p>"
    },
